    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-7d158414-3ba6-4b37-b9da-85ce1c471d7c" n="0339" facs="#m-b0552c1e-0bc4-4279-8527-528b0e7d2c44" /><div xml:id="m-b3fb742e-2ffb-4f4c-98e4-c1388050a541">
            <lg xml:id="m-a7cfe5fe-12f5-4158-8369-7b1ed8882a8e">
              <l xml:id="m-ab8edad6-b848-4772-9e9c-3c3d4c10f172" facs="#m-d19bfcfc-1e46-4c89-98c8-9b61752de0af" label="text-like">sunday at Prime.</l><l xml:id="m-4c133753-4a1a-4c56-82b2-8592ee1e08fa" facs="#m-5d05306f-3d46-4b70-8b84-0e823e2095d5" label="ambiguous">227</l><l xml:id="m-74df5248-f502-44e0-8de0-2ae5d7827caf" facs="#m-761b316d-4a40-4476-b623-e4eb03442b9f" label="lyrics-like">In tóto córde méo exquisivi te:*</l><l xml:id="m-f59d3497-b3d1-41c5-ad13-87891a112e1c" facs="#m-f2e0b94d-6e99-4854-b2a3-82451d4a3c91" label="lyrics-like">Aufer a me oppróbrium et con¬</l><l xml:id="m-0821b681-60ac-4c85-9e22-12d8477424d7" facs="#m-3f6e314b-5653-493e-a89f-29483013a781" label="lyrics-like">temptuquia testimónia túa</l><l xml:id="m-299dc5a5-9370-4a4e-a8f1-9bced7004fb6" facs="#m-05275fdd-9c12-4d2b-867e-e05f1da35998" label="lyrics-like">ne repéllas me a mandátis tuis.</l><l xml:id="m-5c59e1d7-dc9d-4995-a9e2-58832586387c" facs="#m-db79c68b-321f-4b9e-93f9-6c098994f226" label="lyrics-like">In córde méo abscóndi elóquia</l><l xml:id="m-d31b2ffe-4bf1-4b09-a3a1-1b49ac40749a" facs="#m-1b1a3407-184d-46e4-9d91-57935f12d136" label="ambiguous">exquisivi.</l><l xml:id="m-57190653-64f0-4108-bb2f-87f6e9585321" facs="#m-42901b03-5270-40b3-9ca0-64ac0bf413f4" label="lyrics-like">Étenim sedérunt principes, et ad¬</l><l xml:id="m-848a2c74-0e82-4594-b15a-53d0938775f0" facs="#m-f86ea1f9-c6ed-4fb9-b570-61b4dde08698" label="lyrics-like">túa:* ut non péecem tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-15028094-90bc-4af3-aa4e-06dd8b4c3b55" facs="#m-064b941a-ae90-4807-b2a9-dd85ee14222f" label="lyrics-like">Benedictus es Domine: * dóce</l><l xml:id="m-17d2996e-6c53-4d3e-98f0-638a653971a1" facs="#m-97489530-21bd-460a-b6f6-77d2a72314f4" label="lyrics-like">vérsum me loquebantur': * sérvus</l><l xml:id="m-2462512c-860f-4842-980f-d8959e7e0945" facs="#m-d815da3c-5774-4ae9-a2bb-b63a5f0d26dd" label="lyrics-like">me justificatiónes túas.</l><l xml:id="m-5544723a-6329-4551-9a89-cac76ad4e447" facs="#m-1913a0eb-165a-48ba-a3a5-cd2874b1441b" label="lyrics-like">autem túus exercebátur in justifica¬</l><l xml:id="m-03633818-e94b-4ff4-8ce5-55ca92d8bad4" facs="#m-56bc241a-5839-4dfc-b50e-d66dcd1d1b5c" label="lyrics-like">In lábis meis, * pronuntiávi</l><l xml:id="m-f3e535e5-23cb-4afb-80c4-121326264f18" facs="#m-970aa212-2abc-4af3-9056-b6d25da292dc" label="lyrics-like">tiónibus túis.</l><l xml:id="m-a35e1874-8bb4-4563-a4fa-bfdfd862026f" facs="#m-68a93ada-bea3-4a6d-b9cd-7ab5dcc95e8c" label="lyrics-like">Nam et testimónia túa meditá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f524adfa-a495-49fb-8e63-78a69bda9bb2" facs="#m-b70bf5b2-e07e-408c-bebc-4dfa140cc25d" label="lyrics-like">ómnia judicia óris túi.</l><l xml:id="m-47850d72-fe4d-4dcc-9299-32da63d39495" facs="#m-60536ee1-ecd8-4004-99c4-95aa9f6df847" label="lyrics-like">In vía testimoniórum tuórum de¬</l><l xml:id="m-2501a3be-eba8-4164-91cd-f38b826976c9" facs="#m-91fdc6b7-bd79-486b-bea0-9a9b975a4fd9" label="lyrics-like">tio méa est :* et consilium méum</l><l xml:id="m-ada85462-9f1d-4773-a004-9e218eb7605c" facs="#m-688f2c4d-85f3-4fd0-ba4e-ea8d0235444b" label="lyrics-like">lectátus sum, * sicut in ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-5fc0b942-1287-4cb8-9588-7060311fc2bb" facs="#m-504f9363-1fa0-441e-bf57-8b322028f786" label="lyrics-like">justificatiônes túae.</l><l xml:id="m-526fa352-0703-48ed-94d8-edfbb3bf9af4" facs="#m-26d94bbc-9bd0-47db-827f-c14452578f1c" label="lyrics-like">Adhaésit paviménto ánima méa:"</l><l xml:id="m-6bdb4a73-1fdd-449f-8017-cf3fc551e0f4" facs="#m-fa8e8d43-3e41-4ae9-abe7-99e5a468b672" label="ambiguous">divitiis.</l><l xml:id="m-48c7caec-d249-4563-a573-b925f35c50aa" facs="#m-9508891b-ba39-4045-856b-c4237edc4810" label="lyrics-like">In mandátis tuis exercébor :* et</l><l xml:id="m-15e0f6eb-21f6-4c75-a929-70e66d0232ba" facs="#m-7ee34689-1ab4-494f-947c-5ee4eca9b8c3" label="lyrics-like">vivíficamesecúndum vérbum túum.</l><l xml:id="m-eb137aec-03ef-49b5-a911-12237edea176" facs="#m-c016ee1a-5837-426f-997a-73c975e40e77" label="lyrics-like">considerábo vias túas.</l><l xml:id="m-bdb22536-f478-47b4-8f0c-78db684d920f" facs="#m-b3eb3d96-8bd3-42e9-96fa-e7d71eff42a0" label="lyrics-like">Vías méas enuntiávi, et exau¬</l><l xml:id="m-471e8ec0-65ad-43d6-be79-35884f7c4b84" facs="#m-3529c1ee-b56c-4bd1-859b-9029033f6a1e" label="lyrics-like">In justificatiónibus túis meditá¬</l><l xml:id="m-8203b0b8-7af3-4f80-8866-845044b851c6" facs="#m-902fd7a7-579a-4402-9569-ce15f24da43a" label="lyrics-like">disti me :* dóce me justificatiónes</l><l xml:id="m-4239f8e5-9123-46cd-a4e1-bcb9eb20efb1" facs="#m-f3f20918-7e8f-46e0-a115-e28bec442509" label="lyrics-like">*non obliviscar sermónes</l><l xml:id="m-ce0cfc98-146d-4684-8686-05e787e930e9" facs="#m-23c40575-089a-492e-85be-ccf183a6f07d" label="ambiguous">tuas.</l><l xml:id="m-efea9dbf-f19c-466a-8024-c695778928d4" facs="#m-de8a8258-454d-4d78-97d0-f4f540175df6" label="lyrics-like">Víam justificatiónum tuárum in¬</l><l xml:id="m-d23dd37a-cab2-4d6a-8a46-653018a23a63" facs="#m-a6b6f6f7-0fd4-430c-a508-5efc3f366ffc" label="lyrics-like">túos.</l><l xml:id="m-5cb392cc-b42f-4d5f-b658-e20da4fe7929" facs="#m-66e37a15-4977-4d70-bfcf-fd41e40461fa" label="ambiguous">Psalm 118. II.</l><l xml:id="m-98bfb2c1-e0c1-47da-8ca9-11ca8a3efc73" facs="#m-6ad7656d-b43a-4dfe-a571-8bf1f61406dd" label="lyrics-like">strue mé : * et exercébor in mira¬</l><l xml:id="m-90b84ad1-a896-47e2-9c8a-83c47297b1f1" facs="#m-3878af4b-5f24-4331-a893-7e5740433900" label="lyrics-like">DEtribue sérvo túo, vivifiea me:"</l><l xml:id="m-84cc68cb-ca19-4e0f-8686-59d118041ca3" facs="#m-04d1f333-2805-4f56-8743-5b9ffbe72199" label="lyrics-like">bilibus túis.</l><l xml:id="m-ecd0123d-8062-4eb5-a666-cf024e26df32" facs="#m-d413a2d5-6cdb-4447-a51d-c554fc9aa082" label="lyrics-like">Dormitávit ánima méa prae taé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1bf39ea-1cd6-44c3-ad8f-1f711ae425e5" facs="#m-0fb1f272-adaf-460c-9ad7-e789c01c8453" label="lyrics-like">It et custódiam sermónes túos.</l><l xml:id="m-fb519cd6-591d-4a4c-92ed-faca4f32c43d" facs="#m-86294f30-a367-449e-960a-1bad56e900a5" label="lyrics-like">dio:* confirma me in verbis túis.</l><l xml:id="m-1a5ae9e5-d400-4812-a2fa-3939eec8acaf" facs="#m-1a5dc631-09b7-4f77-949a-210401dd506e" label="lyrics-like">Revéla óculos méos :* et consi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6201d6e2-23b2-4e37-b4e2-cb54b89b36fd" facs="#m-1eb54a54-3d9a-482c-8845-1fc6be2c9488" label="lyrics-like">Viam iniquitátis ámove a me:"</l><l xml:id="m-bc05b234-8d31-4195-8c92-a66977941211" facs="#m-7840ebbc-fe86-4e28-926d-3c6457a587ec" label="lyrics-like">derábo mirabilia de lège túa.</l><l xml:id="m-23244d79-de43-4c0c-af47-8cea7f6f7b72" facs="#m-229e0a35-8752-4d32-bbac-c22de02d0642" label="lyrics-like">et de lége túa miserère méi.</l><l xml:id="m-4701753a-de0f-4c35-9166-dca43f8186e2" facs="#m-088584a6-1cd2-43cc-88d7-618c0720dbff" label="lyrics-like">Incola égo sum in térra : * non</l><l xml:id="m-ccbf23e4-f8ae-442c-9548-4e0225bed235" facs="#m-5c7d5cc0-6b1b-4cbd-8ba5-3f16d9ed7c9a" label="lyrics-like">Viam veritátis elégi : * judicia</l><l xml:id="m-95c6cb6f-f773-46aa-a1ca-38de775ec8b9" facs="#m-eb02bce3-b1c5-4a82-a898-09ff03e88b8f" label="lyrics-like">abscóndas á me mandáta túa.</l><l xml:id="m-8c43fae1-0902-4d3f-a2ae-9eaa9ed2661a" facs="#m-7c58d319-f0d0-4c2f-b597-7b1a51f97179" label="lyrics-like">túa non súm oblitus.</l><l xml:id="m-23ffbd64-6e55-4e80-981f-11a61202dec7" facs="#m-bfb37c89-1e32-47c3-acd1-4ad38cfe14f5" label="lyrics-like">Concupivit ánima méa desideráre</l><l xml:id="m-e9d4634e-c11d-4f95-abde-2a71151c9782" facs="#m-f802443c-ac5b-4460-a465-e136928c9c63" label="lyrics-like">Adhaési testimóniis tuis Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-40f9c958-7e19-4eee-80fa-98934be37830" facs="#m-cf7e6e2b-22a5-40df-90a3-a205b796e42a" label="lyrics-like">justificatiónes tuas, * in ómni tém¬</l><l xml:id="m-04cdba25-fbef-47f4-96fe-e9f8b3c52d42" facs="#m-3b8574f8-70d5-4707-8537-a16c695ba652" label="lyrics-like">ne : * noli mé confúndere.</l><l xml:id="m-b8ca606a-5f36-441f-bd15-6a62a3f15dc4" facs="#m-3861bf52-8e5a-45a9-baa7-193db680f1df" label="ambiguous">pore.</l><l xml:id="m-6e9f80bc-d3d8-414b-ad1c-63725b4c5d9c" facs="#m-01a58a53-c8b0-4f34-b46e-e9782e7584f1" label="lyrics-like">Increpásti supérbos :* maledicti</l><l xml:id="m-0507a4cc-5d09-40f3-ba40-d0b8cf90472f" facs="#m-1d204055-ea1b-40e5-b133-9980e841e8b8" label="lyrics-like">Víam mandatórum tuórum cu¬</l><l xml:id="m-4de47050-d34b-42c6-89be-eeb92881eb25" facs="#m-63d5075e-a5d0-4f71-8bad-4c68c8e3701b" label="lyrics-like">qui declinant a mandátis túis.</l><l xml:id="m-7d27b321-4429-48dc-a5d0-749ea50439f0" facs="#m-4a7b6cbe-6297-4742-a196-169638510325" label="lyrics-like">eurri, * cum dilatásti cor méum.</l><l xml:id="m-633072ca-6a59-4807-8432-0a81633c6d7d" facs="#m-fbfe2ea2-4463-44ae-97eb-5dab568e16b5" label="text-like">The Creed of St. Athanasius is said on the Feast of the Most Holy Trinity.</l><l xml:id="m-172970e1-86a6-4c81-860f-8148ccbd953f" facs="#m-1fe07f71-08f9-43e2-9ee5-4db967235199" label="text-like">It is also said on the Sundays after the Epiphany and after Pentecost, if the</l><l xml:id="m-3d3fcfa6-05df-4129-9a00-bbe64c5cfde4" facs="#m-32ba7fd1-7eac-4afb-9e92-d0b6fb6e6285" label="lyrics-like">omce of the Sunday is said as in the Psalier, it is omitiéd if the Commemo¬</l><l xml:id="m-060645f0-7d1f-4855-89ef-692e733bed60" facs="#m-bf4fa49c-ee5e-4902-831a-9d13d93508b4" label="text-like">ration of a Double feast or of an Octave occurs on the Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-65f9e906-7b40-4f3e-b369-219a5cc151b2" facs="#m-18ea0802-b8d5-44a9-8f6f-68cfea1d8479" label="lyrics-like">Increátus Páter, increátus Filius,»</l><l xml:id="m-dc52f2d6-b4c9-441d-a855-33ee0f03a3b4" facs="#m-87c8fa26-d27c-4854-a758-42f88e8d8eed" label="text-like">The Athanasian Creed.</l><l xml:id="m-941e5558-641d-40ae-9570-b72ae0a3432c" facs="#m-33d32390-3aab-43bc-a024-89cdd6f00e99" label="lyrics-like">increátus Spiritus Sánctus.</l><l xml:id="m-b70ceefe-902b-45a3-937d-62347d55388e" facs="#m-0c48a198-9792-460d-91d2-f6c1fb630003" label="lyrics-like">Uicúmque vult sálvus ésse,</l><l xml:id="m-dd3b811a-e17b-4461-bf0a-338bb80dfc30" facs="#m-fee5da24-1981-41b4-b958-dfae3da6a8e5" label="lyrics-like">Imménsus Pâter, imménsus Fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d3a3a60f-a76f-412a-b6f5-ba2a01c1a116" facs="#m-05994817-7c27-4a08-bba6-363597ad4d08" label="lyrics-like">U ante ómnia ópus est ut téneat llius, * imménsus Spiritus Sánctus.</l><l xml:id="m-e060f813-14cb-4f76-ac11-85df0756c6de" facs="#m-a1afbc83-36e6-497b-aeb9-cd30e2fd4201" label="lyrics-like">Aetérnus Pâter, aeternus Filius,»</l><l xml:id="m-bf1374fc-8692-4b2c-aedd-ed1d366a0741" facs="#m-13691298-35d0-4492-bb6e-0e938ad52108" label="lyrics-like">cathólicam fidem:</l><l xml:id="m-b1035e97-9f1e-48fd-9337-0f4731af7772" facs="#m-d4f1d759-6a56-4f40-9fe2-d0562900d92a" label="lyrics-like">Quam nisi quisque íntegram in-laetérnus Spiritus Sánctus.</l><l xml:id="m-8a20ac9e-9c48-4d31-b988-8f693ddd1094" facs="#m-557dc219-d10e-4fda-8a8c-697a829279da" label="lyrics-like">violatámque serváverit, * absque</l><l xml:id="m-a3c11514-3ca8-486d-be8e-4425497be440" facs="#m-b5d74649-3192-426f-8f57-6a50190a3ee4" label="lyrics-like">Et tamen non trés aetérni, * sed</l><l xml:id="m-27a1adec-a179-4609-a3ac-9bcbc4352cad" facs="#m-d3436d43-748c-4bea-91bd-b1f72bb9ecba" label="lyrics-like">dúbio in aetérnum peribit.</l><l xml:id="m-bf607d75-3d2d-4fc6-bb0d-6aa30bac7aad" facs="#m-999c100a-9057-4984-852c-482069ccd3cd" label="lyrics-like">únus aetérnus.</l><l xml:id="m-a4d2f876-b67c-4a3a-ac7d-7af1783e2820" facs="#m-25935470-9b34-4173-8d6a-3a062c9422c9" label="lyrics-like">sicut non tres increáti, nec trés</l><l xml:id="m-3f7c6894-bfe0-443f-99cf-a4e02cf076c2" facs="#m-87d67f79-cda8-45e6-9ce6-47b1a0ab49cb" label="lyrics-like">Fides autem cathólica haec est :t</l><l xml:id="m-16eee15a-4f40-4149-8867-1b5534be6754" facs="#m-ab143fd4-98f1-4c81-bdf2-7e4ce54ca56d" label="lyrics-like">ut únum Déum in Trinitâte, * et limmensi, * sed únus increátus, et</l><l xml:id="m-96f75f85-323d-4c9e-9a7b-f6448aa1df48" facs="#m-6e47fcfd-93ac-472e-b556-f3ee0ae31e10" label="lyrics-like">Trinitátem in unitáte venerémur : únus imménsus.</l><l xml:id="m-5160d05a-b676-43da-afe9-1adce3a35dae" facs="#m-9ad0884a-df35-4b15-938b-3cdcc734b7a2" label="lyrics-like">Simíliteromnípotens Páter, omni¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a7cdaee-9123-4f84-9ec3-d1593553cb9b" facs="#m-20c62a5a-b9a5-4e91-91c9-b04f36a01062" label="lyrics-like">Neque confundéntes persónas,</l><l xml:id="m-4519e268-f620-4453-97f4-03646c9f83c6" facs="#m-fed3cbc9-42d8-4dc4-a683-e2558cff39d9" label="lyrics-like">potens Filius, * omnípotens Spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-7c82cced-2f95-4104-b941-1fc91239f0cd" facs="#m-e828dbc3-1fad-4c8f-a291-cabf80c1eae0" label="lyrics-like">neque substántiam separántes.</l><l xml:id="m-54debd0e-7246-44a8-a5ad-a81d1af49bfb" facs="#m-74ca992a-cb25-4167-a095-ce2c26d60000" label="lyrics-like">Alia est enim persóna Pâtris, alia (Sánctus.</l><l xml:id="m-9fc4cf32-a395-425d-a715-0422adbfc970" facs="#m-6ec52d13-0653-4720-b46e-07d15935a33a" label="lyrics-like">Fili, * ália Spiritus Sancti.</l><l xml:id="m-f0bc730f-ca81-4089-8e41-f49ac0ae0316" facs="#m-e8e4e8c1-3cfa-43e1-befb-3ad1c3df7514" label="lyrics-like">Et tamen non tres omnipotén¬</l><l xml:id="m-b1385173-58ec-4bac-9d2e-54774efcc162" facs="#m-fd527de3-81bd-48c6-bb50-5ed179ea6950" label="lyrics-like">Sed Pátris, et Fili, et Spiritus tes, » sed únus omnipotens.</l><l xml:id="m-c8199953-9bb5-4f7d-9d2f-63f8e5a2bfea" facs="#m-5f23b40b-0b13-411b-9e91-0d6b2aed3bbe" label="lyrics-like">Sancti úna est divinitas, * aequális</l><l xml:id="m-bce52b28-7074-4c34-a58e-12be632e01b7" facs="#m-47309da8-d55c-4373-9d15-cd6aa3d5e443" label="lyrics-like">Ita Déus Pâter, Béus Filius,</l><l xml:id="m-ff60be90-3f0d-427e-9e26-53810d9786e5" facs="#m-4af307de-87e0-49e3-9455-8a090be6b561" label="lyrics-like">Déus Spiritus Sãnctus.</l><l xml:id="m-ae2825b9-13f8-46e4-b075-e7c09ab318c1" facs="#m-2c4f90c5-0124-4948-a6f2-0709e65137c2" label="lyrics-like">glória, coaetérna majéstas.</l><l xml:id="m-5f023f40-1726-46b0-a6dd-47ca4db0417f" facs="#m-216b636a-1cd6-4c62-a2ac-0a74df3914a2" label="lyrics-like">Quális Pâter, tális Filius,*talis</l><l xml:id="m-2d550948-5520-412a-b5de-ab4f1fcbf9d0" facs="#m-5f29010f-1719-49d9-9b53-62ab8a0711b9" label="lyrics-like">Et tamen non tres Dii, * sed únus</l><l xml:id="m-c25a17e0-e7d5-4d13-bedf-c2a63e3bca3b" facs="#m-c158d543-6c15-471d-bd11-34515009c432" label="lyrics-like">Spiritus Sánctus.</l><l xml:id="m-f6dc5b88-32bd-42d8-890a-7187f62b4b9a" facs="#m-08003dc6-ac76-4d49-a62d-7df3192da68e" label="lyrics-like">lest Déus.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>